---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="A little about who I am and what I work on."
  filename="about.mdx"
  filepath="~/about.mdx"
  currentPath="/about"
  language="MDX"
  gutterLines={40}
>
  <p class="eyebrow"><span class="kw">export</span> <span class="str">const</span> role = 'student &amp; builder'</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>

  <p>
    I'm Syahirah — currently a student, and I spend most of my free time
    building small things and writing about them here.
  </p>

  <p>
    This site itself is one of those things: an Astro blog styled to look
    like the editor I write everything else in, Tokyo Night and all.
  </p>

  <h2>What I'm into</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Building small web projects end-to-end</li>
    <li>Clean, opinionated UI — themes, type, spacing</li>
    <li>Writing things down instead of forgetting them</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Currently</h2>
  <p>
    Studying, and using this blog as a place to keep notes on what I learn
    along the way — coursework, side projects, and the occasional deep dive.
  </p>

  <h2>Say hi</h2>
  <p>
    Best way to reach me is the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> — I read
    everything that comes through.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
